WEBVTT

00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.825 --> 01:38.985
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:55.105 --> 01:57.945
I've got three things to report.

01:59.505 --> 02:00.425
First,

02:01.145 --> 02:05.185
next week's denim promotion is canceled.

02:06.305 --> 02:08.105
The good news is
I've already collected their deposits.

02:09.265 --> 02:10.545
Second,

02:11.305 --> 02:13.785
about the overdue payment
you've been asking me to chase,

02:13.865 --> 02:15.745
they're asking for another two months.

02:16.505 --> 02:17.985
He's making excuses about being broke,

02:18.065 --> 02:18.945
saying

02:19.505 --> 02:21.585
he might have to pull his kid
out of kindergarten.

02:23.505 --> 02:24.825
Last thing,

02:25.345 --> 02:28.465
the sponsor for the ice sculpture event
is cutting the budget.

02:28.545 --> 02:30.025
They said that's all they can offer.

02:31.785 --> 02:33.225
Should we still do it?

02:36.905 --> 02:39.665
I know we need money
to expand into new markets.

02:47.065 --> 02:47.905
Let's do it.

02:49.145 --> 02:50.265
Something is better than nothing.

02:51.305 --> 02:52.145
Boss,

02:52.745 --> 02:53.985
keep your chin up.

02:55.985 --> 02:59.025
I don't have any good news,

02:59.105 --> 03:02.065
but I was the first one
to join this company.

03:02.145 --> 03:04.265
As long as this company exists,

03:04.345 --> 03:05.585
I'm not leaving.

03:06.385 --> 03:07.785
Even if I don't get paid.

03:08.825 --> 03:10.185
Just don't stress yourself out.

03:26.705 --> 03:28.065
Xing,

03:28.825 --> 03:30.265
how did it go

03:30.825 --> 03:32.945
with the bank?

03:33.785 --> 03:35.025
Yes, I want to take out a loan.

03:35.905 --> 03:39.025
Okay. I'll bring the property deed over.

03:39.105 --> 03:40.585
Okay. Thanks.

03:50.265 --> 03:51.265
Are you really selling it?

03:54.545 --> 03:55.585
Take it over.

04:06.225 --> 04:09.745
SHANG ZHITAO, WELCOME BACK TO BEIJING

04:15.225 --> 04:16.105
Mr. Li,

04:16.184 --> 04:19.345
is your company looking to expand?

04:21.384 --> 04:22.225
Mr. Guan,

04:23.185 --> 04:25.145
I'd like to recommend
a great business partner.

04:28.825 --> 04:30.865
Someone will contact you
to discuss the details.

04:30.945 --> 04:32.545
I gave them your number.

04:33.985 --> 04:35.385
Thank you so much, Mr. Luan.

04:36.025 --> 04:37.825
You helped us out a lot

04:37.905 --> 04:39.745
when we needed it most.

04:40.345 --> 04:41.385
I'll be sure to tell Boss.

04:42.385 --> 04:43.345
No.

04:43.425 --> 04:44.465
Don't tell her.

04:45.225 --> 04:47.505
Whether it works or not
depends on Ms. Shang's negotiation skills.

04:47.585 --> 04:49.185
I'm just making the introduction.

04:49.265 --> 04:50.625
I can't decide the outcome.

04:51.785 --> 04:52.745
One more thing.

04:52.825 --> 04:54.145
Send me your office address.

04:54.785 --> 04:56.505
I bought two down jackets to send over.

04:57.025 --> 04:57.985
Pass them to her.

04:58.065 --> 04:59.505
Sure. Thank you, Mr. Luan.

05:11.985 --> 05:16.345
BEIJING TO HARBIN FLIGHT BOOKING PAGE

05:19.265 --> 05:21.985
COMPLETE YOUR BOOKING: BEIJING TO HARBIN

05:49.465 --> 05:50.385
Shang Zhitao.

05:56.305 --> 05:57.345
What's wrong?

06:01.345 --> 06:03.065
I mortgaged my apartment.

06:03.145 --> 06:04.305
I'm just

06:05.905 --> 06:07.185
feeling a little down.

06:14.505 --> 06:15.625
Why did you mortgage your apartment?

06:16.585 --> 06:18.865
The company is barely staying afloat.

06:20.705 --> 06:21.705
Everything costs money.

06:21.785 --> 06:23.625
I'm still waiting to collect 100,000 yuan.

06:26.985 --> 06:28.505
If you need it,

06:28.585 --> 06:29.505
I can help you out.

06:35.865 --> 06:37.665
Luan Nian, you're trying to help,

06:38.345 --> 06:40.705
but I don't need it.

06:40.785 --> 06:42.745
I've figured something out.

06:42.825 --> 06:45.265
I sold the car

06:45.345 --> 06:46.425
and mortgaged the house.

06:46.505 --> 06:48.225
I still have some savings.

06:49.105 --> 06:50.905
You know me. I want to make it on my own.

06:56.265 --> 06:57.665
Why are you here?

06:59.985 --> 07:00.865
I'm here to apply.

07:02.545 --> 07:03.505
For what?

07:04.345 --> 07:05.505
Driver, assistant,

07:06.025 --> 07:07.265
or boyfriend.

07:07.345 --> 07:08.225
I'm fine with any of them.

07:11.225 --> 07:12.105
You're not suitable.

07:12.185 --> 07:14.545
-How am I not?
-In every way.

07:16.865 --> 07:18.065
Ms. Shang,

07:19.185 --> 07:20.225
give me a chance.

07:22.385 --> 07:23.305
Mr. Luan,

07:23.385 --> 07:25.065
this is a startup.

07:25.585 --> 07:27.865
We're too small for someone like you.

07:29.385 --> 07:30.665
I don't charge much.

07:32.345 --> 07:33.745
Even if we're hiring,

07:33.825 --> 07:35.065
we need someone local,

07:35.625 --> 07:37.105
who can stay long-term.

07:37.905 --> 07:38.905
If you're okay with it,

07:38.985 --> 07:40.145
I can move here.

07:43.545 --> 07:44.585
That's not necessary.

07:45.105 --> 07:47.745
My next step is expanding
into digital advertising.

07:48.345 --> 07:50.105
It's a completely new business.

07:50.185 --> 07:52.865
The execution and expertise required
aren't your strengths.

07:53.545 --> 07:55.505
Do you still think
you're the right fit, Mr. Luan?

07:55.585 --> 07:57.385
If you hire someone local,

07:57.905 --> 08:00.585
training and integrating them
will take at least six months.

08:01.785 --> 08:03.465
If you trust my abilities,

08:04.065 --> 08:06.025
I'll work for free
for the first six months.

08:08.185 --> 08:09.105
Mr. Luan,

08:10.185 --> 08:12.145
does Lime know what you're doing?

08:12.225 --> 08:13.385
Doesn't matter.

08:24.185 --> 08:25.025
Be my driver then.

08:31.105 --> 08:32.025
Coming.

08:41.264 --> 08:42.345
DISINFECTANT SPRAY

08:50.985 --> 08:52.105
HOURS: 9:30 A.M. - 10:00 P.M.
OLD COUPLE'S TAVERN

08:52.185 --> 08:53.105
Mr. and Mrs. Shang,

08:53.185 --> 08:56.145
I brought you some Beijing specialties
and some health supplements.

09:02.385 --> 09:03.225
Why are you here again?

09:04.185 --> 09:05.185
Luke.

09:36.225 --> 09:37.105
Luan Nian,

09:37.625 --> 09:39.345
Luke doesn't look well.

09:59.745 --> 10:02.185
Don't worry. I told you
I'd help take care of Luke.

10:07.505 --> 10:10.385
MEAT PATTY

10:12.745 --> 10:13.905
Your new business
is finally on the right track.

10:14.505 --> 10:17.505
Now I get to have a proper drink
with a rising young entrepreneur.

10:18.025 --> 10:19.345
So?

10:19.865 --> 10:21.985
Did Luke manage to wait for you

10:22.505 --> 10:23.905
out there in the freezing cold that day?

10:27.505 --> 10:28.905
He's not young anymore.

10:28.985 --> 10:30.425
Weren't you afraid he'd freeze to death?

10:31.865 --> 10:32.865
Lumi.

10:34.665 --> 10:36.065
After all these years,

10:36.145 --> 10:39.025
I still owe you an apology.

10:39.105 --> 10:40.145
I was keeping it from you.

10:40.225 --> 10:42.185
Stop. Do you really think
I'm that clueless?

10:42.265 --> 10:44.185
I knew something was up.

10:45.545 --> 10:47.545
Back when you first graduated,
you were so sweet

10:47.625 --> 10:49.465
and innocent.

10:49.545 --> 10:52.265
Every time you saw him,
your face turned bright red.

10:52.345 --> 10:53.985
The funniest one
was that time in the elevator.

10:54.065 --> 10:55.905
I wondered what you two were up to,

10:55.985 --> 10:56.905
so I snuck a peek.

10:57.425 --> 10:58.545
The way you looked at him.

11:01.705 --> 11:03.225
There was one time when it was obvious.

11:03.305 --> 11:04.785
I knew right then.

11:05.465 --> 11:06.425
When?

11:07.425 --> 11:08.545
The shady agency gave you trouble.

11:10.145 --> 11:11.505
Luke stepped in to help.

11:12.025 --> 11:13.105
That's when I knew.

11:13.185 --> 11:14.025
Everything clicked.

11:14.105 --> 11:15.905
These two are definitely
more than colleagues.

11:17.105 --> 11:18.265
Looking back,

11:18.785 --> 11:20.345
it really was obvious.

11:20.425 --> 11:21.625
Way too obvious.

11:21.705 --> 11:23.545
Keeping up the act was exhausting.

11:24.145 --> 11:24.985
Cheers.

11:30.705 --> 11:31.585
Tao.

11:32.705 --> 11:34.105
How's Luan Nian treating you?

11:35.665 --> 11:37.025
What do you mean?

11:38.705 --> 11:39.905
In every way.

11:39.985 --> 11:40.985
How does he treat you?

11:45.425 --> 11:46.265
Pretty well.

11:47.665 --> 11:50.385
So he's the whole package?

11:52.145 --> 11:52.985
‎I…

11:53.065 --> 11:54.585
He's alright.

11:54.665 --> 11:55.865
What about you?

11:55.945 --> 11:57.425
How are things with Will?

11:57.505 --> 11:58.745
Getting married soon?

12:01.865 --> 12:03.265
Well.

12:03.785 --> 12:05.145
He's pretty old-fashioned.

12:05.225 --> 12:07.065
His whole family is.

12:07.145 --> 12:08.665
Also,

12:09.825 --> 12:11.265
I don't think they like me much.

12:12.545 --> 12:14.505
How could they not like you?

12:15.385 --> 12:17.065
I'm a millionaire
from demolition compensation.

12:17.145 --> 12:19.185
What's wrong with that?

12:19.265 --> 12:21.105
Who wouldn't like that?

12:27.585 --> 12:29.585
Are you really not giving
Luan Nian another chance?

12:31.385 --> 12:32.665
Why are we talking about me again?

12:43.745 --> 12:44.585
I'll finish it.

12:48.545 --> 12:50.785
You're in your element
when you're back in the Northeast.

12:51.585 --> 12:53.425
Come on, finish your drink.
Don't say that.

12:53.505 --> 12:57.145
MEAT PATTY

12:57.225 --> 12:58.345
Ms. Shang,

12:58.425 --> 12:59.985
I sent you a video.

13:00.065 --> 13:01.145
Take a look.

13:02.105 --> 13:03.225
Shang Zhitao,

13:04.825 --> 13:05.985
do you remember?

13:06.865 --> 13:08.425
We promised we'd watch
the aurora together.

13:09.785 --> 13:11.145
But you disappeared.

13:14.145 --> 13:15.665
You have to see them.

13:16.345 --> 13:17.905
They're beautiful.

13:23.265 --> 13:24.105
I'm sorry.

13:28.625 --> 13:29.905
I really am sorry.

13:30.825 --> 13:32.425
I know I'm a mess.

13:33.465 --> 13:34.705
I don't deserve to be loved.

13:38.025 --> 13:39.745
I just wanted to tell you…

13:45.105 --> 13:46.185
I miss you.

13:48.025 --> 13:49.305
I miss you so much.

13:52.385 --> 13:53.665
I love you.

13:54.945 --> 13:56.545
I love you.

14:11.505 --> 14:12.985
Luan Nian doesn't know
I recorded this video

14:13.065 --> 14:14.465
or have sent it to you.

14:17.865 --> 14:19.545
I sent you this video

14:19.625 --> 14:20.825
because I wanted you to know

14:21.745 --> 14:23.105
he really loves you.

14:23.185 --> 14:24.945
If you love him too,

14:25.465 --> 14:26.985
don't let him go so easily.

14:43.545 --> 14:44.545
Don't worry.

14:45.305 --> 14:47.545
Luke just needs two more days of IVs.

14:48.065 --> 14:49.305
He'll be back
to his energetic self in no time.

14:51.225 --> 14:52.185
Luan Nian,

14:53.785 --> 14:54.785
thank you.

15:27.505 --> 15:28.865
Actually, I regret

15:29.785 --> 15:31.585
not hugging you

15:32.905 --> 15:34.145
or comforting you

15:34.945 --> 15:35.865
when you took Luke away last time.

16:42.785 --> 16:45.185
If it weren't because I wanted to prove
I wanted to be with you forever,

16:46.625 --> 16:47.505
I'd have made you pay

16:50.025 --> 16:51.865
for it today.

16:55.345 --> 16:56.705
My flight back to Beijing is tomorrow.

16:57.225 --> 16:58.465
Mind if I stay tonight?

17:05.545 --> 17:06.424
Shang Zhitao,

17:07.305 --> 17:08.184
I'm sorry.

17:10.345 --> 17:11.224
For everything that happened.

17:13.585 --> 17:15.224
I truly loved you.

17:17.265 --> 17:18.665
I'm sure you could tell.

17:18.745 --> 17:21.345
DISINFECTANT SPRAY

17:26.025 --> 17:27.145
We've still got a long road ahead.

17:28.625 --> 17:29.745
I'll take it one step at a time.

17:39.305 --> 17:40.185
You…

17:41.145 --> 17:42.185
I'll sleep in the guest room.

18:18.305 --> 18:19.345
Can't sleep?

18:28.385 --> 18:29.305
Let me help.

18:42.825 --> 18:43.985
I can't sleep either.

18:47.425 --> 18:48.265
Luan Nian.

19:07.585 --> 19:08.985
If you don't want this,

19:09.865 --> 19:11.465
I'll stop right now.

21:14.905 --> 21:16.225
She's probably fine.

21:16.305 --> 21:18.585
She hasn't answered her phone.
I'll go check on her.

21:21.225 --> 21:22.265
Luan Nian.

21:23.865 --> 21:25.185
Is she out cold?

21:25.265 --> 21:26.225
Dad.

21:27.425 --> 21:28.265
I…

21:28.985 --> 21:30.025
I was exhausted yesterday.

21:30.105 --> 21:30.945
I didn't hear the phone.

21:31.025 --> 21:32.785
Don't worry. Go back first.

21:32.865 --> 21:34.625
I'll clean up and get up soon.

21:35.225 --> 21:36.065
Alright.

21:36.865 --> 21:37.705
Mr. Shang.

21:48.305 --> 21:49.345
You're here.

21:55.225 --> 21:58.225
You two aren't wearing enough.

22:00.625 --> 22:01.785
Come upstairs now.

22:10.865 --> 22:11.985
Mr. and Mrs. Shang,

22:12.745 --> 22:14.185
I'll take responsibility for Tao.

22:21.305 --> 22:23.065
What's going on here?

22:23.145 --> 22:24.145
Explain yourselves.

22:27.985 --> 22:28.905
Well…

22:28.985 --> 22:30.105
Keep quiet.

22:34.505 --> 22:35.585
You talk.

22:37.305 --> 22:38.305
Here's the truth.

22:40.025 --> 22:41.945
I'm sure you already know

22:42.025 --> 22:43.265
about what happened between Tao and me.

22:44.385 --> 22:46.825
We were together for six years.

22:47.585 --> 22:49.465
Because of some misunderstandings,

22:50.585 --> 22:51.625
she broke up with me.

22:54.505 --> 22:55.985
But when we met again this time,

22:56.585 --> 22:58.945
we realized we still
had feelings for each other.

23:00.705 --> 23:02.025
That's basically it.

23:06.265 --> 23:08.545
You're not even married,
yet you're already living together.

23:08.625 --> 23:10.305
That's no way to behave.

23:10.905 --> 23:12.505
How could you be so foolish, Tao?

23:13.465 --> 23:14.505
We can get married.

23:15.425 --> 23:16.465
I'm ready anytime.

23:24.345 --> 23:25.385
I'm just waiting for Tao's answer.

23:33.505 --> 23:35.705
I mean it. Mr. and Mrs. Shang,

23:37.145 --> 23:39.425
I know a woman's reputation matters.

23:39.945 --> 23:41.105
I'll take responsibility.

23:51.825 --> 23:53.145
You heard him.

23:53.705 --> 23:55.145
Why are we still sitting here?

23:56.065 --> 23:58.585
He wants to marry her.
Let them talk it over.

23:58.665 --> 23:59.505
Let's leave.

24:01.745 --> 24:03.305
Tao, put on more clothes.
Don't catch a cold.

24:05.505 --> 24:06.425
You two talk it over.

24:06.505 --> 24:07.705
We'll come back later.

24:28.385 --> 24:29.825
What's wrong, Flora?

24:32.625 --> 24:33.505
What did you call me?

24:35.785 --> 24:36.745
My dear wife.

24:41.865 --> 24:42.985
I was telling the truth.

24:43.505 --> 24:45.345
If we hadn't broken up,

24:45.865 --> 24:47.465
we'd already be married.

24:49.865 --> 24:52.105
If we hadn't broken up,

24:53.345 --> 24:54.705
our kid would probably be grown up by now.

24:57.105 --> 24:58.665
You really just say
whatever comes to mind.

24:59.265 --> 25:00.105
Can you really take responsibility?

25:00.185 --> 25:01.265
I can.

25:05.985 --> 25:07.185
I mean every word.

25:10.425 --> 25:12.385
Back then, I thought
I'd planned everything perfectly.

25:13.545 --> 25:14.985
I'd spend six months in the US,

25:15.625 --> 25:18.065
then come back, and you'd receive
the Specialist title you deserved.

25:24.345 --> 25:25.185
Tao.

25:27.025 --> 25:28.385
I want to spend
the rest of my life with you.

25:43.225 --> 25:45.145
The Beijing branch has just opened.

25:45.225 --> 25:47.865
From now on, I'll be splitting my time
between Harbin and Beijing.

25:48.945 --> 25:50.785
2021, BEIJING

25:54.785 --> 25:55.945
Luke,

25:56.025 --> 25:56.985
we're going back to Beijing.

25:59.425 --> 26:00.785
Luke.

26:06.585 --> 26:08.265
I got praised at the summit.

26:08.785 --> 26:09.985
Ms. Shang Zhitao.

26:10.065 --> 26:11.945
We'd like to invite you back to Lime

26:12.025 --> 26:14.425
to share your experience
as one of our event partners.

26:19.025 --> 26:19.865
Sure.

26:22.785 --> 26:23.745
Shang Zhitao,

26:24.345 --> 26:25.585
welcome back to Beijing.

26:43.185 --> 26:44.345
Shang Zhitao.

26:46.065 --> 26:48.465
Flora is like a different person now.

26:50.305 --> 26:51.745
It's New Year's Eve.

26:51.825 --> 26:52.825
Don't stay out too late.

26:53.625 --> 26:54.625
Happy New Year in advance, everyone.

26:54.705 --> 26:57.105
Happy New Year.

26:57.745 --> 26:58.785
Flora.

27:00.345 --> 27:01.865
Let's grab a meal sometime.

27:01.945 --> 27:02.785
As friends.

27:04.465 --> 27:06.185
We'll talk about dinner another time.

27:06.745 --> 27:08.225
We're supposed to go
grocery shopping together.

27:11.505 --> 27:12.625
Flora, I have to ask.

27:12.705 --> 27:15.425
How did you ever put up with his temper?

27:16.305 --> 27:18.465
Are you seriously gaslighting
my wife in front of me?

27:27.665 --> 27:29.065
We're heading out. Bye.

27:29.145 --> 27:30.585
-Bye.
-Bye.

27:39.065 --> 27:40.265
What's wrong?

27:40.345 --> 27:41.185
What time will you be back?

27:41.265 --> 27:43.065
We're going shopping
for Chinese New Year's supplies together.

27:43.945 --> 27:45.185
I still have something to do.

27:45.265 --> 27:46.105
I'll be back later.

27:50.745 --> 27:51.625
Also,

27:52.865 --> 27:54.305
I might be bringing someone home.

28:10.865 --> 28:12.145
Where are we going?

28:13.985 --> 28:14.865
Come with me.

28:32.465 --> 28:34.465
Welcome to Flora's Museum
of Time &amp; Eternity.

28:35.225 --> 28:37.185
I'm your personal tour guide,

28:38.425 --> 28:39.265
Luan Nian.

29:07.665 --> 29:08.945
This is Shang Zhitao in 2012,

29:09.025 --> 29:10.665
when she first arrived in Beijing.

29:14.345 --> 29:18.545
She was terrified but also curious
about this unfamiliar city.

29:19.465 --> 29:21.065
She treated everything with awe.

29:23.945 --> 29:27.105
She devoted all of her time to work.

29:29.865 --> 29:33.585
Unfortunately, she wound up with a boss
who tried to make her quit every day.

29:34.825 --> 29:36.585
That boss was a real jerk.

29:40.985 --> 29:42.305
Luckily,

29:42.385 --> 29:45.025
I happened to run into my boss that night.

29:45.105 --> 29:46.305
He drove me home.

29:51.865 --> 29:52.745
Do you know something?

29:53.785 --> 29:55.465
The first time I drove you home,

29:55.985 --> 29:56.825
it wasn't on my way.

30:00.985 --> 30:02.425
It never was.

30:03.345 --> 30:04.945
I took the long way
because I wanted to drive you home.

30:06.705 --> 30:07.545
Get in.

30:17.785 --> 30:19.025
MAKE EVERY DAY COUNT

30:19.105 --> 30:20.345
WISHING YOU ALL THE BEST
AS YOU KEEP GROWING

30:20.425 --> 30:21.665
ANONYMOUS

30:38.945 --> 30:40.505
Shang Zhitao, you were brave back then.

30:42.385 --> 30:44.025
I went there to save you.

30:44.585 --> 30:47.065
But in the end,
you were the one who saved me.

30:59.305 --> 31:00.225
Shang Zhitao.

31:01.265 --> 31:02.185
There's something I need to say.

31:05.945 --> 31:07.545
About the handbag.

31:09.465 --> 31:10.785
My mother loves handbags,

31:12.385 --> 31:14.185
so I mistakenly assumed

31:14.265 --> 31:16.105
every woman did too.

31:17.545 --> 31:19.225
When I gave it to you,

31:20.465 --> 31:21.985
I just wanted to give you the best,

31:27.025 --> 31:29.305
but I simply didn't know how to express
how much I cared about you.

31:31.105 --> 31:32.625
I'm sorry

31:32.705 --> 31:33.545
I made you uncomfortable.

31:37.585 --> 31:39.185
Your old bag was worn out.

31:39.265 --> 31:40.545
Have a new one.

31:45.305 --> 31:46.265
It's okay.

31:56.305 --> 31:58.305
I remember you complimented me.

32:00.025 --> 32:01.265
You hired a great employee.

32:01.785 --> 32:03.345
She turned my impossible
into a possibility.

32:03.865 --> 32:06.345
The prototype of the database
you've all seen

32:06.425 --> 32:08.465
was led

32:08.545 --> 32:10.745
by our new teammate, Flora.

32:12.865 --> 32:14.665
I just wanted everyone to know

32:15.185 --> 32:16.785
that you'd accomplished something amazing.

32:17.545 --> 32:18.545
I was proud of you.

32:37.145 --> 32:39.185
These are the flowers Sun Yuanzhu gave me.

32:40.105 --> 32:40.945
Yes.

32:43.505 --> 32:45.105
Actually, they suited you perfectly.

32:46.105 --> 32:47.865
I lied because I was jealous.

32:51.665 --> 32:52.865
Sun Yuanzhu was a wonderful person.

32:53.905 --> 32:55.105
I should've thanked him.

33:07.105 --> 33:08.625
Just call me Luan Nian.

33:09.905 --> 33:10.785
Luan Nian.

33:20.025 --> 33:22.025
The boss had already
fallen in love with her.

33:23.545 --> 33:24.945
He just didn't realize it yet.

33:25.705 --> 33:28.305
He was the first one
to fall for Shang Zhitao.

33:33.425 --> 33:35.065
You can control your feelings for someone.

33:37.905 --> 33:39.025
If you mind,

33:39.105 --> 33:40.945
we can keep our relationship a secret.

33:41.905 --> 33:43.785
Encourage you. Praise you more.

33:43.865 --> 33:44.825
I'll remember that.

33:46.265 --> 33:47.225
We promised

33:47.825 --> 33:49.065
to be honest with each other.

33:51.545 --> 33:52.745
I'm not good with sweet words,

33:53.385 --> 33:54.545
but I miss you.

33:55.105 --> 33:56.185
I want to see you.

34:00.145 --> 34:01.705
He couldn't express himself.

34:01.785 --> 34:02.825
He didn't know how to love.

34:03.985 --> 34:05.225
He lacked empathy.

34:06.705 --> 34:07.785
He once got into a fight.

34:08.985 --> 34:10.025
He pretended to be sick.

34:14.465 --> 34:15.744
And for Shang Zhitao,

34:16.344 --> 34:17.465
he traveled across

34:17.985 --> 34:19.465
many cities

34:20.545 --> 34:21.545
just to see her.

34:22.625 --> 34:23.824
Quietly.

34:49.905 --> 34:51.025
DAD, SHANG ZHITAO, MOM
WE'LL STAY WITH YOU ALWAYS

34:51.105 --> 34:53.585
These are little Tao's handprints
and footprints from when she was born.

34:54.625 --> 34:57.465
These were her tiny shoes and mittens.

34:57.985 --> 34:59.385
And this was her favorite Walkman.

35:01.505 --> 35:02.945
You worked hard last night.

35:05.265 --> 35:06.905
Actually, he is

35:07.785 --> 35:09.025
a bit lonely.

35:09.545 --> 35:12.105
He has a big fish tank at home,

35:12.745 --> 35:14.585
but there's only one fish in it.

35:22.985 --> 35:26.465
SHANG ZHITAO'S BUCKET LIST
BEFORE TURNING 30

35:29.105 --> 35:29.945
It's

35:31.305 --> 35:33.105
my bucket list.

35:47.065 --> 35:49.705
SHANG ZHITAO'S BUCKET LIST
BEFORE TURNING 30

35:52.625 --> 35:57.385
SHANG ZHITAO'S BUCKET LIST
BEFORE TURNING 30

35:59.305 --> 36:00.465
Shang Zhitao.

36:02.505 --> 36:03.825
I really regret

36:05.505 --> 36:07.265
what I said to you.

36:09.185 --> 36:10.465
I've never thought about any of this.

36:11.985 --> 36:13.425
And I don't have a bucket list.

36:19.705 --> 36:20.625
From now on,

36:20.705 --> 36:23.225
I want to be part
of every item on your bucket list.

36:24.745 --> 36:25.865
Today, I want

36:27.745 --> 36:28.905
to build a dream for you.

36:33.385 --> 36:34.905
This museum

36:35.905 --> 36:37.785
holds so much of your past.

36:38.985 --> 36:40.585
It also holds our future.

36:55.065 --> 36:56.665
Ms. Shang Zhitao,

36:58.265 --> 36:59.465
I'm asking

37:00.185 --> 37:01.985
for a place

37:02.545 --> 37:03.985
in your museum.

37:41.705 --> 37:42.985
Luke.

37:46.425 --> 37:47.865
Come here. Sit.

37:48.625 --> 37:50.385
-Why is Luke dressed like that?
-Sit.

37:55.345 --> 37:57.265
MARRY DAD

38:10.625 --> 38:11.505
Shang Zhitao,

38:13.465 --> 38:14.385
will you marry me?

38:32.745 --> 38:35.105
Tao, say yes already.

38:35.185 --> 38:37.185
You'd be crazy not to take the deal.

38:37.265 --> 38:38.665
You can claim half his assets first.

38:38.745 --> 38:39.585
That's right.

39:00.745 --> 39:01.905
I will.

39:41.785 --> 39:43.265
Don't be shy!

39:43.345 --> 39:44.745
So sweet!

39:48.345 --> 39:49.905
-Perfect!
-Great!

39:49.985 --> 39:51.305
Shang Zhitao!

39:54.105 --> 39:55.185
Be happy!

39:55.785 --> 39:56.785
Great!

40:04.465 --> 40:06.305
-Great.
-Yeah!

40:07.505 --> 40:09.985
Their love survived the bitter winter

40:10.505 --> 40:13.065
and finally welcomed the early spring.

40:14.105 --> 40:16.065
From there, through the blazing summer,

40:16.625 --> 40:20.105
they entered the brightest season
of their lives.

40:20.985 --> 40:23.065
And that warmth will never fade.

40:23.825 --> 40:24.665
May you,

40:25.185 --> 40:26.105
may I,

40:26.185 --> 40:27.385
may all of us

40:27.465 --> 40:28.905
be well.

40:42.865 --> 40:46.105
THE END
